+# 17n live fixes (QA's Bubbles 17n live test, 12 Nov 2026)
+
+Branch `claude/17n-live-fixes` in both apps.
+
+| Item | Bubbles | Ask Sunny |
+|---|---|---|
+| 4b "late to reoepn the store" is a late opening | `REOPEN_IS_OPENING_ENABLED` (f497a5d9) | Ported (a950851c0). Sunny's card policy is read by `ca-policy.ts` NAMED, so the reading is a NAMED rule there too. |
+| 4c a pasted bare "Corrective Action Form" asks what is needed | `BARE_FORM_NAME_ASKS_WHAT_ENABLED` (b0d99d10) | Ported (a5e749cbe). |
+| 3 "this form is about cash handling" on an open Coaching draft | `THIS_FORM_IS_ABOUT_ENABLED` (5c0428a6) | **Not needed.** The bug does not reproduce there: the old path's revision rewrites the Details from that wording, with or without the reader's own edit. Sunny keeps the same replay case as a guard (`status: "fixed"`, 70cdb2c73). |
+| 2 a pasted customer review: say it is the customer's words, ask what the manager saw | `PASTED_REVIEW_ASKS_WHAT_YOU_SAW_ENABLED` (2fb49114) | Ported (e081da7d1). Same bug there. |
+| 4a a Corrective Action card that cites no policy asks which applies (QA's ruling: none picked, the Issue as typed) | `CA_NO_POLICY_ASKS_WHICH_ENABLED` (c51d293e) | Ported on the same branch. |
